    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customer review sentiment tagger for a sheet\nPaste customer reviews into a sheet. The AI tags sentiment and main topic so you can spot patterns.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ba8e731d-acff-5bf7-9dc1-af2d3da1bb58",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Reviews** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (review_text). Leave sentiment, topic, short_summary empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where sentiment is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "8b7692b9-1e8a-5b18-b326-99acbb7e210f",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
